      "Microsoft.VSTS.Common.AcceptanceCriteria": "<ul><li>Returning customer with saved payment details reaches checkout → saved method available for selection without re-entering card details. </li><li>Customer opts to save payment details, payment completes → details stored for future checkouts. </li><li>Saved method used at checkout, payment completes → customer reaches the confirmation page. </li> </ul>",
